{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "9490200e020040bb69931b4aa3f451290a405dc92619d296b6a2e5f333a233a2", "ja": "アイドルの才能", "zh": "偶像的才能", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "05c1cb98caff736897317387d7f943e5176a59db1bdb3c2572720189bc28e97e", "ja": "未来達は『ネクスト・アイドル・ウェーブ』\nの最終選考まで残ったものの、結果は敗退。\n次を見据えてレッスンに励む一同の様子を見\n守りながら、プロデューサーは、「アイドル\nとは何か？」と、哲学的な事を考えていた。", "zh": "未来等人虽然一路闯入了“Next Idol Wave”\n的最终选拔，但结果还是落选了。\n制作人在守望着大家为了展望未来而努力训练的模样时，\n思考起了“偶像究竟是什么？”这样哲学性的问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0bb7089ea49d12aee41c51a8f1e11d532bb3c06572503072952cbb96cdd50bb2", "ja": "（オーディションからひと月後、世界中のアイドルの\n祭典、ネクスト・アイドル・ウェーブが開催された）", "zh": "（试镜结束一个月后，全球偶像的盛典“Next Idol Wave”举办了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_07_1001_p", "source_sha256": "96afafc8b8b3564a0d340c86c8d40fd095e43d8ef1770a1628295025ebe9a163", "ja": "（厳しい審査を潜り抜け、最終選考まで進むも……\n765プロのアイドル達は、惜しくも敗退した）", "zh": "（她们闯过了严苛的评审，一路进入最终选拔……但765事务所的偶像们还是遗憾落败了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_07_1002_p", "source_sha256": "28e69a4608e5eec27f82d7c3920fbee1aad05c41776b2e1d91ad466d6b957702", "ja": "3人とも、お疲れさま。よくやったよ。今回は、\nとにかく層が厚かったとしか言いようがないな……。", "zh": "你们3个人，都辛苦了。表现得很棒哦。这次只能说，\n竞争对手的整体实力实在是太强了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_07_1003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "71c9b8e1da2c01affe5fa83297522e656b867bc20978d784ba5cfd5b5f0f54f8", "ja": "ううっ、も～、悔しい～！\n……あ～あ、世界デビューしたかったなぁ～。", "zh": "呜呜，真是的～，太不甘心了～！\n……唉～，好想在全世界出道啊～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_07_1004_015siz", "source_sha256": "dc04787bc6817bebd071cd53fafaa193d41116344ab277cb9c684a60a841cd2b", "ja": "そうね……でもよくやったと思うわ、私たち。\n玲音さんや詩花さん相手にも、善戦だったし。", "zh": "是啊……不过，我觉得我们已经做得很好了。\n面对玲音小姐和诗花小姐，我们也打得相当不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_07_1005_p", "source_sha256": "c8b02aeff0c6aa4582542960ef49ff2a5ab0f7616114da9066f361f8c14b543f", "ja": "こちらが努力した分、向こうも積み重ねてきた感じが\nしたよ。本当に、すごいイベントだったな……。", "zh": "我们付出了多少努力，对方似乎也积累了同等的努力。真的是一场很精彩的活动啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_07_1006_014mir", "source_sha256": "3699f8185057b49f3710a39e9558d1d6438d55f558bc8625eb22d3f61327a9d0", "ja": "{$P$}さん！\nあの、これって、今回だけなんですか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生！\n那个，这个只有这一次吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_07_1007_p", "source_sha256": "2a98b03a63dfe2aaae755d2ffc1d26831b8f4730a3ec9335e2205ff8b5e738bd", "ja": "どうだろうな。興行的には大成功だと聞いてるし、\nもしかしたら次があるかもしれないけど……。", "zh": "这可不好说。我听说从商业角度来看是大获成功，\n说不定还会有下一次……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_07_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "7d6536b659930604dec9360b2912412405c832ee567de53e6a067c0c3328867f", "ja": "わかりましたっ！　今度は絶対、私たちが優勝します！\n静香ちゃん、翼、次こそがんばろうね！", "zh": "明白了！下次我们一定会夺冠！\n静香、翼，下一次一定要加油哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_07_1009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "6a43eca727f156ea672c02ca7ec3a9011821991a3b10540903c7d8925f611d99", "ja": "わたしも、次はもう絶対負けたくない～！\nぜーったい、優勝してグランプリとるんだから！", "zh": "我也绝对不想再输了～！\n我们一～定要拿冠军，赢得大奖！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_07_1010_015siz", "source_sha256": "9e8b1d23038e3a83e21edd183eff94260779bf474957563b01f6117976cbce1c", "ja": "未来、翼……ふふっ。ええ、そうね！\n次は絶対優勝できるように、がんばりましょう！", "zh": "未来、翼……呵呵。嗯，说得对！\n为了下次一定能夺冠，我们一起努力吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_07_1011_p", "source_sha256": "60c7198b619bdb8dcdb8914d132a8e45edbc8358466593266218a3c49bb1332c", "ja": "（そんな訳で、未来達は次のネクスト・アイドル・\nウェーブ出場を目指し、今日もレッスンの真っ最中だ）", "zh": "（就这样，未来她们为了争取参加下一届偶像浪潮，今天也正在认真练习）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_07_1012_014mir", "source_sha256": "2a543d778dde74dda12d51f8e2e69b3d6f6b50e92a617875278d975de3a977a7", "ja": "ワン、ツー、スリー、フォー、ワン、ツー……。\n……あれ？　ここ、どこ？", "zh": "一、二、三、四，一、二……\n……咦？这里是哪里？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_07_1013_016tsu", "source_sha256": "eacea76cf00253e46c822dc675d789bdb42c86332fad93ddf4337afbab3d5e7d", "ja": "未来～。\nなんで未来だけ、別の方向に行っちゃうの？", "zh": "未来～。\n为什么只有未来，跑到别的方向去了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_07_1014_015siz", "source_sha256": "85de4253dde6cfe8165780de5909ae5205947b7946326c339d1d1cf2ae483ae0", "ja": "ここ、公演前にはちゃんとできてたわよね、未来。\n……成長した分、リセットしてない？", "zh": "这里，公演开始前明明已经好好完成了吧，未来。\n……你该不会是把成长的部分重置了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_07_1015_014mir", "source_sha256": "40616219af928c9269f45b85d1f4abc96566cab96b7acfe8c4d04eed86618a8b", "ja": "あれ？　……えへへっ♪", "zh": "咦？……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_07_1016_015siz", "source_sha256": "8b6b332dcc96a61982b09b7068ab7d5ddcc59f7db80b597761a4fd418f957f90", "ja": "もう、笑ってごまかそうとしてもダメですからね！\nもう1回お手本見せるから、いっしょにやるわよ。", "zh": "真是的，想笑着糊弄过去也是不行的哦！\n我再给你示范1次，一起做一遍吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_07_1017_014mir", "source_sha256": "2b2d0c9726c62d4794e4484bae319b59c94619fd2d27ffbee8c5119d8b3b601a", "ja": "はーい！", "zh": "是──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_07_1018_p", "source_sha256": "a261749b986406974cd4037dcfe5a206d9a0a9273d8ee60ce71152329f531fe0", "ja": "（ステージ直後は、誰よりも気合いが入っていた\n未来だったが……レッスンでは、相変わらずだ）", "zh": "（刚结束舞台表演时，未来还比谁都干劲十足，可一到训练时，还是老样子啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_07_1019_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7077fe49a5b5ee852914f79fdcf307f7ff350766df5b76dd9a0013ffdf0ce33f", "ja": "ねえねえ、{$P$}さん。\n未来をセンターにしたこと、後悔してない？", "zh": "喂喂，{$P$}先生。让未来当中心，你没有后悔吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_07_1020_p", "source_sha256": "a3e4c4d2fa5258d365cc55c7010dc8b660c725775c742f8ead4fae0b2701716b", "ja": "う……そんな事はないぞ。", "zh": "呃……才没有那回事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_07_1021_016tsu", "source_sha256": "329c0cf840bca1b01d4b8c4849d047cc4db778880fc057e52504963b07606c77", "ja": "本当にー？", "zh": "真的——？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_07_1022_p", "source_sha256": "1bb217f02c3b6c5ed56e5b5d787fa0be3302448f67f02829d6bcdea6e8b662c9", "ja": "本当だって。", "zh": "我说真的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_07_1023_015siz", "source_sha256": "dec3b5be29fbfc4f972b231baae1fa1f8aa00ba24ab5de70ac5de0c7c8da1459", "ja": "{$P$}、すみません。\n私たちのダンス、動画で撮ってみてくれませんか？", "zh": "{$P$}，不好意思。\n能不能帮我们把舞蹈拍成视频？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_07_1024_014mir", "source_sha256": "8585afd8eb27e87366aa488eeba3951066dc6264f732b2ede50a65beddc5863e", "ja": "えっ、動画撮るの？\nじゃあそれ、ブログにアップしようよ♪", "zh": "诶，要拍视频吗？那就上传到博客吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_07_1025_015siz", "source_sha256": "05eefec43d6e333e74f9b6ffd79bc749d90bedc80655e5555489d19a97381a75", "ja": "ブログ用じゃないわよ。どうして未来の振り付けが\n逆になっちゃうか、わかってもらうために撮影するの。", "zh": "不是为了上传博客啦。是为了让你明白，未来的舞蹈动作为什么会反过来，才拍下来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_07_1026_016tsu", "source_sha256": "2555afe1cd679c9ef7a7fcac4eac13a6d609edc192fabd699cbc38bc9565b786", "ja": "え～！　動画アップするなら、\nわたしもいっしょに踊る～！", "zh": "诶～！要上传视频的话，我也要一起跳～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_07_1027_015siz", "source_sha256": "4a9b06406e91269a790786ff27f43f20d8bc6614c74a553f326146b616154835", "ja": "だから、勉強のためだって言ってるでしょ！\nもう！", "zh": "所以我都说了，是为了学习才拍的！\n真是的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_07_1028_015siz", "source_sha256": "ca15f8ec5bce8cfe50d996b38c99b937d3e9e42e8fd32211db48eeec127c15f1", "ja": "それに上げたいなら上げてもいいけど。今のままだと、\nラストで未来だけ逆方向に進む動画になるわよ？", "zh": "而且，你要是想调高的话，调高也没关系。不过照现在这样，最后会变成只有未来朝反方向走的视频哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_07_1029_014mir", "source_sha256": "77eeed8cbe1221b423d7265ee6e0a74f0f3cc4300404cdaf999361e6421f0231", "ja": "あは！　それ、何かちょっと面白いかも♪", "zh": "啊哈！那样的话，好像也有点意思呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_07_1030_016tsu", "source_sha256": "5752e1028eea9e092c6617b0dac40ce409d1e8d2b5df88405c82656ec57494c3", "ja": "も～。未来、ちょっとは危機感感じなよ～。\nセンターでしょ？", "zh": "真是的～。未来，稍微有点危机感啦～。\n你可是C位吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_07_1031_015siz", "source_sha256": "28532bb040f95a5d7484d4d24f4a15cb79534b65fba8e0390b4828b41e1a5750", "ja": "はぁ、なんだか私のほうが恥ずかしくなってきた……。", "zh": "唉，总觉得反倒是我开始害羞起来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_07_1032_p", "source_sha256": "1698bee94948bc497b3a14b445ce9d86e767f776e4c4bd589641bf4f5604b8fc", "ja": "ま、まあまあ。成長の記録という事で……\nたまには、そういうのもいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "没、没什么。就当作成长记录吧……\n偶尔这样一次，也挺好的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_07_1033_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1b803a3d4cca47cdd00b6cba4fe8d97e8ca628bf488ee7d725e64faf1d5e4977", "ja": "え～っ。\n{$P$}さん、ホントにいいの？", "zh": "诶～？\n{$P$}先生，真的可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_07_1034_p", "source_sha256": "362a494c22f261c0c8436b7ea3febb759374fb1bb53e70093c4b823b3b9a8dc6", "ja": "本番じゃないしな。それにお客さんにも、\n案外楽しんでもらえるかもしれないし。", "zh": "又不是正式演出。而且，说不定客人们也会觉得挺有意思的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_07_1035_015siz", "source_sha256": "6d7bf2c30f338526dea296ac7c1a5b89cecb6ae811ced111cc5ce317576772ce", "ja": "はぁ……。わかりました。\n{$P$}が、そう言うなら。", "zh": "唉……我知道了。既然{$P$}这么说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_07_1036_015siz", "source_sha256": "418f65c4017ba10c261fe8addf982c9219871d4a003582c6cac109a937e469a1", "ja": "でも未来には、正しい振り付けも\nちゃんと覚えてもらいますからね！", "zh": "不过，未来也得把正确的舞蹈动作好好记住才行哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
